{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05787","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其三 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫岩隈兮青谿侧，云松烟茑兮千古色。\n芳靃蘼兮荫蒙茏，幽人构馆兮在其中。\n靃蘼蒙茏兮开樾馆，卧风霄兮坐赮旦。\n粤有宾兮时戾止，樵苏不爨兮清淡已，永岁终朝兮常若此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}